{"time": 1755611823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405748248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "2163053609", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧安安”摸摸脑壳“两位之后再见”"}
